#%PAM-1.0
# MK in-app Face ID (mk-face-auth, installed by setup.sh): the face only.
# Passwords are never checked through this service: its helper answers any
# local caller, so a password stack here would be a root guessing oracle.
# PINs stay in the apps, fingerprints go through fprintd, passwords through
# polkit's own prompt.
auth       required     pam_howdy.so
account    required     pam_permit.so
